			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3460
			},
			"text": " How long could the human race survive on only cannibalism?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,460",
				"to": "00:00:04,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3460,
				"to": 4460
			},
			"text": " This is a bad idea."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:04,460",
				"to": "00:00:05,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 4460,
				"to": 5680
			},
			"text": " Do you need me to clarify that?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:05,680",
				"to": "00:00:06,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 5680,
				"to": 6680
			},
			"text": " I hope not."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,680",
				"to": "00:00:07,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6680,
				"to": 7680
			},
			"text": " It's a horrible idea."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:07,680",
				"to": "00:00:10,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 7680,
				"to": 10840
			},
			"text": " There are about 500 trillion calories of human in the world."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,840",
				"to": "00:00:14,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10840,
				"to": 14560
			},
			"text": " If frozen or otherwise preserved, that would be enough, at least in terms of raw calories,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:14,560",
				"to": "00:00:19,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 14560,
				"to": 19120
			},
			"text": " to keep a tiny viable population of around 100 people alive for millions of years."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,120",
				"to": "00:00:23,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19120,
				"to": 23320
			},
			"text": " Eating nothing but meat sounds bad, nutritionally, but the lack of vegetables wouldn't necessarily"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:23,320",
				"to": "00:00:24,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 23320,
				"to": 24320
			},
			"text": " kill you."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,320",
				"to": "00:00:27,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24320,
				"to": 27960
			},
			"text": " Under some circumstances, people can survive on high-meat or all-meat diets, especially"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:27,960",
				"to": "00:00:30,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 27960,
				"to": 30200
			},
			"text": " if they eat things like organ meat and bone marrow."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:30,200",
				"to": "00:00:32,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 30200,
				"to": 32880
			},
			"text": " There are some vitamins and nutrients found in those which are missing from the narrower"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:32,880",
				"to": "00:00:36,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 32880,
				"to": 36200
			},
			"text": " range of mammals, skeletal muscle, and fat in the typical Western diet."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:36,200",
				"to": "00:00:39,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 36200,
				"to": 39280
			},
			"text": " There are a lot of things we don't understand about nutritional deficiencies, and a lot"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:39,280",
				"to": "00:00:43,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 39280,
				"to": 43800
			},
			"text": " of dispute, to put it mildly, over what kind of diets are or aren't healthy."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:43,800",
				"to": "00:00:47,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 43800,
				"to": 47040
			},
			"text": " But no matter what nutrients we would or wouldn't get, we would face a bigger problem."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:47,040",
				"to": "00:00:48,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 47040,
				"to": 48600
			},
			"text": " Contaminated food."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:48,600",
				"to": "00:00:52,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 48600,
				"to": 52000
			},
			"text": " Even if you cooked your meat, it would be hard to avoid all kinds of disease exposure as you"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:52,000",
				"to": "00:00:54,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 52000,
				"to": 54360
			},
			"text": " work your way through the remains of the human population."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:54,360",
				"to": "00:00:56,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 54360,
				"to": 56800
			},
			"text": " In a small enough population, every outbreak is a pandemic."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:56,800",
				"to": "00:00:59,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 56800,
				"to": 59120
			},
			"text": " it wouldn't take long for something to wipe you out."
		}
	]
